ard payment, select the Pay Fees link. For additional information, see How to Pay Fees . For your paid fees: To view or print your receipt, select the View Receipt link. To view or print a report of all fees assessed and payments received to date, select Reports in the upper right corner and select Payment and Fee Detail . Loading... &nbsp; Inspections &amp; Appointments To view all inspections on this permit , click the Reports link in the upper right, next to the Login button. It displays all inspections submitted into our system by the end of the previous day. Common Inspection Tips: To schedule a Pre-Construction Conference or Grading Season meeting, please call (206) 684-8860 between 7:30 AM and 4:00 PM, Monday - Friday. To schedule an on-site or phone consultation with your inspector: Schedule an Advisory inspection if it's listed below in \"The Following Are Required\" section. If it's not listed below, schedule the Advisory inspection by calling the Inspection Scheduling Line at (206) 684-8950. To schedule a Land Use/Design Review inspection, please email the assigned Land Use Planner at least one week before the desired inspection date. Their information is displayed on the construction permit face. To find the inspector performing your inspection: Search for your Scheduled inspection below in \"The Following Are Required:\" You may have to click Next if there are multiple pages. Your assigned inspector's name will appear below the inspection type. For Side Sewer permits, Sanitary Final and Drainage Final inspections cannot be scheduled online. Please schedule a Sanitary Cover or Drainage Cover for all side sewer inspection needs. Construction, Grading and Demolition intake appointments may only be cancelled or rescheduled prior to 3:00 pm the day before the appointment, otherwise they will incur a no show fee if they are not used. See Fee Subtitle section 22.900B.020.B. If you are having any other issues scheduling an inspection, please call our Inspection